IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q16-ACCOUNT-TRANSFER.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-SOURCE PIC 9(7).
01 WS-DESTINATION PIC 9(7).
01 WS-TRANSFER PIC 9(7).
01 WS-SOURCE-NEW PIC 9(7).
01 WS-DEST-NEW PIC 9(7).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    ACCEPT WS-SOURCE
    ACCEPT WS-DESTINATION
    ACCEPT WS-TRANSFER
    IF WS-TRANSFER <= 0
        DISPLAY "INVALID TRANSFER AMOUNT"
    ELSE
        IF WS-TRANSFER > WS-SOURCE
            DISPLAY "INSUFFICIENT FUNDS"
        ELSE
            IF WS-TRANSFER > 9999999 - WS-DESTINATION
                DISPLAY "DESTINATION OVERFLOW"
            ELSE
                COMPUTE WS-SOURCE-NEW = WS-SOURCE - WS-TRANSFER
                COMPUTE WS-DEST-NEW = WS-DESTINATION + WS-TRANSFER
                DISPLAY "Source balance: " WS-SOURCE-NEW
                DISPLAY "Destination balance: " WS-DEST-NEW
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF
    STOP RUN.
